{\b OpenLion: please read before installing}\par
\par
OpenLion is an unofficial tool. It is not made by, affiliated with or endorsed by Holden, General Motors or Continental.\par
\par
{\b Use a separate blank SD card.} OpenLion copies your factory map card and writes new maps to a different, blank card. It never writes to the factory card on purpose, but you use OpenLion at your own risk. The author is not responsible for damaged or erased factory cards, a navigation unit that stops working, wrong directions, or anything else that happens from using it. Keep your factory card somewhere safe and its lock switch set.\par
\par
The new maps are made from OpenStreetMap data, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL). The Australia extract is provided by Geofabrik GmbH. Always follow road signs and the road rules over the navigation.\par
